# NOTE on provenance snapshots (src-*/):
# The frozen src-* snapshot directories are INCLUDED in this repo because the
# total working tree (~6.8MB with snapshots at ~4.7MB) is well under 50MB.
# They preserve the exact source provenance for each component:
#   catalog/src-catalog-globals, catalog/src-catalog-types,
#   compat/src-compat-checker, conformance/src-conformance-static,
#   conformance/src-conformance-live, installer/src-installer-core,
#   installer/src-mod-types, installer/src-uninstall, tests/src-tester.
# If they grow past 50MB total, exclude them here and document their origin.

# NOTE on test-results/*.txt: currently ~20KB (raw-test-output.txt), so it is
# tracked. Revisit if outputs grow large.
